  "description": "ASP.NET Core hosting helpers for ArchPillar.Extensions.Localization: serve ARB/XLIFF/PO translation catalogs as static files so a hosted Blazor WebAssembly client can fetch them over HTTP. The static file middleware 404s unknown extensions by default; these helpers register the catalog content types in one call. The core runtime stays dependency-free; this adapter is optional.",
